<title>USA: Rockwell wins space system contract.</title>
<headline>Rockwell wins space system contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Air Force said Tuesday it has awarded Rockwell International Corp a $179 million contract to provide a cost-effective alternate design for the Space and Missile Tracking System Low Earth Orbit.</p>
<p>It said the work is to be completed in September 1999.</p>
</text>
